  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Fairwater Foot Prints &#x2013; Just Transition for water security</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Just Transitions for Water Security (JTWS) Programme will accelerate action towards climate resilient, environmentally sustainable, and socially inclusive management of water resources to achieve water security for all. The JTWS programme will address the critical need for integration of water across multiple agendas, and in doing so will strengthen policy, investment, and accountability to catalyse improved water governance and climate resilience. The programme will directly contribute to the priorities set out in the United Kingdom Government&#x2019;s 2023 International Development White Paper - to deliver economic transformation, reform of international systems, harness innovation and mobilise finance to tackle climate change, biodiversity loss, water-related disasters and food insecurity as well as ensuring safe water, sanitation and hygiene, and opportunities for all.</narrative>
  </description>
